<title>SOUTH AFRICA: PERSETEL SAYS BRAZILIAN TALKS CONTINUE.</title>
<headline>PERSETEL SAYS BRAZILIAN TALKS CONTINUE.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eletronics and electrical company Persetel Holdings Ltd on Friday said talks on a Brazilian investment were continuing.</p>
<p>It said the nature of Persetel's strategic investment in an informaton technology company in Brazil was taking longer to finalise than had been anticipated.</p>
<p>Persetel said a further announcement would be made as soon as the talks have been finalised.</p>
<p>It cautioned shareholders in their dealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
